# UNICEF Evaluation Frameworks

Instruments are versioned. Scores are never overwritten; recapture creates a new assessment.

## Core instruments

1. **ECDI2030** — child development (learning, health, psychosocial, motor)
2. **ECCE quality** — pedagogy, play, inclusion, teacher–child interaction
3. **Child-Friendly School (CFS)** — protection, participation, equity
4. **WASH in Schools** — water, sanitation, hygiene, menstrual health where relevant
5. **Safeguarding** — reporting pathways, staff vetting, incident workflow (restricted)

## Rules

- Rubrics and item text are translatable; numeric scores stay locale-invariant
- Disaggregate reports by site, sex, disability, and displacement **only** when N is large enough to avoid identification
- Kindergarten dashboards show framework coverage and overdue assessments
- Do not invent UNICEF policy text; keep official wording in `content/frameworks/`
